# Vehicles API

A simple Express API to manage the vehicles of a car rental agency.
Data is stored in memory, so it resets every time the server restarts.

## How to run

1. Install the packages:
   npm install
   ```
2. Create a `.env` file with:
   PORT=3000
   ```
3. Start the server:
   npm run dev
   ```

The server runs on http://localhost:3000

## Routes

| Method | URL | What it does |
                ---
| GET | /vehicules | List all vehicles 
| GET | /vehicules/:id | Get one vehicle 
| POST | /vehicules | Create a vehicle (`marque`, `modele`, `immatriculation` required) 
| PATCH | /vehicules/:id | Update one or more
| DELETE | /vehicules/:id | Delete a vehicle 

## Project files

- `server.js` - starts the server
- `routes/vehicules.js` - the vehicle routes
